{
  "job_B24.22_20251003_114609": {
    "text": "On \u00fean nexten fiftene dagen beforen domesd\u00e6ge, sculen gewur\u00f0en foretacnen, \u00fee bodie\u00f0 & tacnie\u00fe \u00feone\nOn \u00fean formen d\u00e6ige, se s\u00e6 heo onhef\u00f0 ofer ealle dunen feowertig elnen on hehnysse swa swa weall, &\nOn \u00fean o\u00f0ren d\u00e6ige, seo s\u00e6 besinc\u00f0 inn agean swa deope, \u00fe\u00e6t unea\u00f0e man gesic\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ufemeste, & swa\nOn \u00fean \u00feridden d\u00e6ige, heo gecer\u00f0 to hire rihte gecynde mid eallen hire streamen, \u00fee heo h\u00e6fde \u00e6t\nOn \u00fean feor\u00f0en d\u00e6ige, ealle s\u00e6lice deor & fissces heo \u00e6teowigie\u00f0 bufe \u00fean y\u00f0en & bellgige\u00f0 swa swa\nOn \u00fean fiften d\u00e6ige, ealle wyrte & ealle treowwes ageafe\u00f0 read swat swa blodes dropen.\n\u00de\u00e6t do\u00f0 \u00fea wyrten, for \u00fey \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea synfulle m\u00e6n heo tr\u00e6den, & \u00fea treowwen, for \u00fean \u00fee \u00fea synfulle\nOn \u00fean sixten d\u00e6ige sculen slean tog\u00e6dere ealle stanes lytle & mycele, & \u00e6lc stan tobrytt on feower\n\u00de\u00e6t heo do\u00f0 for\u00fean, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea arlease m\u00e6nn of heom worhten steples & castles, \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00fe\u00e6r mid\nOn \u00fean seofe\u00f0en d\u00e6ige wur\u00f0e\u00f0 geemnode denen & dunen, swa \u00fe\u00e6t eall eor\u00f0e by\u00f0 sme\u00f0e & emne.\n\u00de\u00e6t betacned, \u00fe\u00e6t God ne forsih\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s \u00feearfendan ansene, ne ne wur\u00f0e\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s mihtiges mannes\nOn \u00fean ehte\u00f0en d\u00e6ige gewur\u00f0\u00f0 swylc eor\u00f0styrung, \u00fe\u00e6t eall middeneard beofe\u00f0 fram eastd\u00e6le to\nOn \u00fean nige\u00f0en d\u00e6ige tofealle\u00f0 castles, & steples, & hus, & circen, & ealle getimbrunge lytle &\nOn \u00fean ten\u00f0en d\u00e6ige, heo gegaderige\u00f0 ealle deaddre manna lymen, swa \u00fe\u00e6t gyf an mann w\u00e6re dead on\nOn \u00fean \u00e6ndeleften d\u00e6ge eorne\u00f0 wilddeor beo tunen, & felden, & manna wunungen, swa swa heo beon\nOn \u00fean twelften d\u00e6ige eorne\u00f0 m\u00e6nn geond eall middeneard byfigende & dr\u00e6dende Cristes tocyme to\nNe heo ne ete\u00f0, ne heo ne drinca\u00f0.\nOn \u00fean \u00fereottende d\u00e6ige fealle\u00f0 sunne & mone, & ealle steorren, for \u00fean \u00fee heo geafen leome \u00fean\nOn \u00fean feowerten\u00f0en d\u00e6ige, ealle libbende m\u00e6nn gewur\u00f0e\u00f0 deade, swa \u00fe\u00e6t heora nan ne by\u00f0 gebyrod,\nOn \u00fean fiften\u00f0e d\u00e6ige cum\u00f0 flod & geswyle\u00f0 \u00fea \u00e6sscen, & bes\u00e6nc\u00f0 ealle \u00fea uncl\u00e6nnyssen into \u00fe\u00e6re",
